[I] Utility library used by MediaInfo/MediaArea projects

[T] ZenLib is a small collection of portable C++ helper classes used across the
[T] MediaArea projects, including MediaInfoLib, to simplify common tasks such
[T] as string, file and threading handling.

[U] https://github.com/MediaArea/ZenLib

[A] MediaArea.net SARL
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[L] ZLIB
